% emoji: 🎩
% category: Jazz
% mood: happy, dance
% level: 3
% tags: ragtime, joplin, piano, jazz, mutopia
% voices: Right hand ; Left hand
% about: The most famous ragtime piece ever! The left hand goes "oom-pah" while the right hand plays bouncy, off-beat notes. This bounce is called syncopation, and it grew into jazz.
